This was the point of the committee -- to recommend policies to try to
provide a reasonable working atmosphere, and try to create an awareness
that women should to be treated seriously as academic peers.

In other words, there is a time and place for everything -- and the 
workplace (here, learning environment) is not the place for this sort 
of behavior.  What a person does in his own time is his business, as 
long as he doesn't infringe upon the rights of others.  If I want nudie
GIFs of the latest chippendale dancers on my computer, I'll do it at
